        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha kūlwa batūmami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji a Balawī, hū kūhaya pye a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Lawī, a benabo yaya ū kūpandīka ngabo nūūlū wingīji hamò na a Baisilaeli. A bene bakūpandīka ī shilīwa shabo kūfuma mu shakwinha īsho Baisilaeli bakamfunījaga SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto, nguno ū wenūbo hū wene ū wingīji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi batūbiza na wingīji hamò na a baana ba ng'wabo; ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo alī wingīji wabo, gīt'ūmo wabisagīīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabo gwa bagabīji ū gwa kūfuma kū banhū abo bakafunyaga nzagamba nūūlū ng'holo kūbiza shitambò, gūkūbiza ūyū, gūkono, na nambo na masaya būbīlī wago, nī sha munda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūyūbinha na a matwajo ga kwandya a ga shilīwa shing'we, nī divai ī mhya na a maguta, hamò nū booya wa ng'holo jing'we ījo jilandya kūmoogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wabasola a benabo, hamò nī shibyalīlwe shabo kūfuma ū mu ng'anda jing'we jose, gīkī būlī lūshikū bīmīīle na kūtūmama milīmo mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū Nawī ūsaama kūfuma mu nzengo gūmò gwaho ū mu Isilaeli ūmo akwikalaga, wiza ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA alalīsole, wikala mu kwifunya kwa ng'hana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho akūtūmama ū mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, gīt'ūmo bakwītīlaga pye a Balawī biye, abo bakūtūmamaga ko ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū wei akwanukūla ū ngabo gwakwe gīt'ūmo bakwanukūlīlaga a biye, nūūlū ūbiza wapandīkile hela kūfuma mu kūjinja malaale ga mu kaya ya ng'wawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa nhūngwa ja malofu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūshika ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha, yaya ū kwilanga kwīta ī ya malofu īyo bakwīyītaga mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizūbiza ho nūūlū ūmò wing'we wa kūmpemba mu moto ng'witūnja wakwe nūūlū nshīke wakwe gīkī abize shitambò; nūūlū wa kwilanga mihayo ya būchūūja, nūūlū kūbeeja mbika ndebe ja mihayo ya mu giiti, nūūlū kūchemba ngoko, nūūlū būlogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizilonga wa kwitana masamva, nūūlū wa kūsoma mu shiganza sha banhū, nūūlū kūtūmamīla myoyo misoso ya mbika jose jose, nūūlū wa kūbūūja mihayo kū banhū bamala kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo wīta mihayo īlī gīko ū kūlī SEEBA alī wa malofu; na īlī kūlwa nguno ya mihayo ya malofu gītī yenīyī hī chene ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīgapeeja a mahanga genayo gang'wīngīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we īng'wigeleelilwe mubize mutī na shilingo ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'hangi wa ng'hana ūmo alī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mahanga ayo ūlīja kūgataaja sī yago gakabadegelekaga abo bakatūmamīlaga nguzu ja giiti hamò na būchūūja. Alīyo ū bebe, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako atakūzunīlīgije ū kwīta ī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūkūbūūkīja ng'hangi wa kūbiza gītī nene, kūfuma mu baana ba ng'wing'we, ūyo shikwigeleelilwe ūng'wigwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mhayo gwenūyū h'ūyo ūkanomba ū SEEBA Mulungu wako aho ūlī kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu, ū mu lūshikū lwa kwibilinga, aho ūkahaya, “Natizongeja kūliigwa ī lilaka lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wane, nū kwikala nakūgūbonaga ū moto ū ntaale gwenūyū, nguno numho nakūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū SEEBA akaniwīla, “Ū mhayo ūyo bagūhaya gūtūngīlīgije; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lūūlū nakūbabūūkīja ng'hangi wa kūbiza gītī bebe kūfuma mu baana ba ng'wabo. Nakūtūūla ī mihayo yane mu nomo gwakwe, hūna ū wei akūyūbawīla īyo nakūnagīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ose ose ūlema ū kwīyiigwa ī mihayo yane īyo alīyīhaya ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo mu lina lyane, nene ng'wenekīlī nakūndīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ng'hangi ūyo witūma wei ng'wenekīlī kūhaya mu lina lyane mihayo īyo natanagīlile nene kwīhaya, ū ng'wenūyo shing'wigeleelilwe abūlagwe; pyī nū ng'hangi wa kūgima kūhanga mihayo mu lina lya bamulungu bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushikile kūbūūja mulīhaya, “Ī gīsī tūkūmana kinehe ī gīkī ū mhayo ū nebe gūtahayiwe na SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo alagūhaye ng'hangi mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA alīyo gūūleka ū kūshikīīla, ū gwenūyo atagūhayile SEEBA. Ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo wihayīlaga dūhū wei ng'wenekīlī; yaya ū kūng'ogoha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
